WEBVTT

00:04.080 --> 00:05.480
My influence

00:06.240 --> 00:08.573
Was never as deep as elder brother's

00:09.400 --> 00:11.067
To succeed in the future

00:11.800 --> 00:13.360
This is the best way

00:13.440 --> 00:15.107
To befriend the Zu family

00:18.480 --> 00:20.080
How long will you be gone?

